    "body": "Problem:\r\nA codeblock in the middle of a listitem terminates the listitem.\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\nInclude the codeblock-terminating column-0 `<` line in the listitem.\r\n\r\nExample:\r\n\r\n    • a\r\n      • b: >\r\n          code\r\n    <\r\n        more b\r\n      • c\r\n\r\nHow gen_help_html.lua renders it:\r\n\r\n    ┌────────────────────────────────────┬─────────┬───────────┬─────────────┬───────────┐\r\n    │                                    │    a    │     b     │   more b    │     c     │\r\n    ├────────────────────────────────────┼─────────┼───────────┼─────────────┼───────────┤\r\n    │ old parser                         │ level 1 │ level 2 ✓ │ outside b ✗ │ level 1 ✗ │\r\n    ├────────────────────────────────────┼─────────┼───────────┼─────────────┼───────────┤\r\n    │ new parser + unfixed gen_help_html │ level 1 │ level 1 ✗ │ inside b ✓  │ level 1 ✗ │\r\n    ├────────────────────────────────────┼─────────┼───────────┼─────────────┼───────────┤\r\n    │ new parser + fixed gen_help_html   │ level 1 │ level 2 ✓ │ inside b ✓  │ level 2 ✓ │\r\n    └────────────────────────────────────┴─────────┴───────────┴─────────────┴───────────┘\r\n\r\nOld parser:\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<div class=\"help-li\">a</div>\r\n<div class=\"help-li\" style=\"margin-left: 3rem\">b: <pre>code</pre></div>\r\n<div class=\"old-help-para\">more b</div>\r\n<div class=\"help-li\">c</div>\r\n```\r\n\r\nNew parser + unfixed gen_help_html:\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<div class=\"help-li\">a</div>\r\n<div class=\"help-li\">b: <pre>code</pre> more b</div>\r\n<div class=\"help-li\">c</div>\r\n```\r\n\r\nNew parser + fixed gen_help_html:\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<div class=\"help-li\">a</div>\r\n<div class=\"help-li\" style=\"margin-left: 3rem\">b: <pre>code</pre> more b</div>\r\n<div class=\"help-li\" style=\"margin-left: 3rem\">c</div>\r\n```\r\n\r\nfix https://github.com/neovim/tree-sitter-vimdoc/issues/163\r\nfix https://github.com/neovim/tree-sitter-vimdoc/issues/146\r\n\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Before/After screenshot</summary>\r\n\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1655\" height=\"938\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/219328c6-3332-43b5-b18c-9ea79df4b2ab\" />\r\n\r\n</details>",
